OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry and partly cloudy. Then
OL,7,Fbecoming rather cloudy overnight with
OL,8,Fa few light showers possible across
OL,9,Feastern Aberdeenshire. Light and
OL,10,Fvariable winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,13,Fcloudy at times. Chance of one or two
OL,14,Flight showers, mainly in the east.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,17,Fsettled although rather cloudy at
OL,18,Ftimes. Chance of one or two light
OL,19,Fshowers in the east. Light winds.
